title: TerraPulse — station-verified land-motion intelligence from NISAR
message: >-
  TerraPulse turns NASA–ISRO NISAR radar data into station-verified,
  uncertainty-quantified land-motion intelligence with auditable
  provenance receipts.
type: software
authors:
  - name: TerraPulse Team
version: 1.0.0
date: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/terrapulse/terrapulse"
keywords:
  - NISAR
  - InSAR
  - land subsidence
  - GNSS validation
  - uncertainty quantification
  - NASA Space Apps
